    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/f8629d34e3c768f95d2ae2b64e0355f0.webp?t=1668724458\" /></div><br>Build industries that will produce diverse goods. Woodworking, agri-food, mining sector\u2026 You'll have to manage a limited supply of resources and optimize production as much as possible to maximize your profits.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/1e91ffb654271fce30da588b87a07531.poster.avif?t=1668724458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/1e91ffb654271fce30da588b87a07531.webm?t=1668724458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/1e91ffb654271fce30da588b87a07531.mp4?t=1668724458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/a5636c8bca390b0cc440a3c318e59213.webp?t=1668724458\" /></div><br>Manage logistics lines that transport, merge, or separate resource flows between buildings. To maximize your profits, you'll have to tie up the logistics of your industries properly.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/48fc920fe259d8fef21abf44009b17a7.poster.avif?t=1668724458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/48fc920fe259d8fef21abf44009b17a7.webm?t=1668724458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/48fc920fe259d8fef21abf44009b17a7.mp4?t=1668724458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/d63eae2dc3129aa82ee9a14e64b1a5b4.webp?t=1668724458\" /></div><br>All these industries bring you wealth but you'll have to deal with some issues... Pollution will be your greatest enemy, it destroys the environment,  reduces the happiness of your workers and stops certain buildings from working. So be careful, don't destroy yourself.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/f489d141427d8568ce835089fc747a29.poster.avif?t=1668724458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/f489d141427d8568ce835089fc747a29.webm?t=1668724458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/f489d141427d8568ce835089fc747a29.mp4?t=1668724458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/1a554e1013c3e0f337af9687fbb0903e.webp?t=1668724458\" /></div><br>To unlock all those infrastructures you must maintain an efficient laboratories network, the more you advance in research the more you will unlock tiers and this will allow you to unlock more advanced research. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/f2a449860307bdb071ba4897ac1c7656.poster.avif?t=1668724458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/f2a449860307bdb071ba4897ac1c7656.webm?t=1668724458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/f2a449860307bdb071ba4897ac1c7656.mp4?t=1668724458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/3c1474540c8484229d869ecbed4c6255.poster.avif?t=1668724458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/3c1474540c8484229d869ecbed4c6255.webm?t=1668724458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/3c1474540c8484229d869ecbed4c6255.mp4?t=1668724458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/ee0fc73de2128f4ff2f3796f07becf1a.webp?t=1668724458\" /></div><br>Your industries will need workers to operate. You will therefore have to assign them and ensure that their happiness remains adequate to avoid revolt.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/48bbf57d508f0f42c7d51edab655bdd8.poster.avif?t=1668724458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/48bbf57d508f0f42c7d51edab655bdd8.webm?t=1668724458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016020/extras/48bbf57d508f0f42c7d51edab655bdd8.mp4?t=1668724458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Are you ready to build great things without destroying yourself? </strong><br><br>Colonia is a management game where you have to build a colony. Create industries, trade, manage the population, manage logistics lines, and limit pollution. While serving the interests of the multinational that hires you or earns your right on your colony if you dream of unlimited power.",
